          <p>
            This is the opposite of the advice for most efficiency equipment, and it is the single most important thing to get right. A heat pump recovers more slowly than a gas burner, so replacing a 50 gallon gas heater with a 50 gallon heat pump unit gives you a worse hot water experience even though the gallons match. Size up one step, and the complaint disappears.
          </p>

